{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261123%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C52%E6%AD%B2%E7%84%A1%E6%A5%AD%E7%94%B7%E8%B6%85%E5%B8%82%E5%81%B7%E5%85%A9%E5%8C%85%E8%9B%8B%E7%B3%95-%E8%AD%A6%E8%AA%A1%E4%B8%8B%E7%A8%B1%E3%80%8C%E6%88%91%E8%82%9A%E5%AD%90%E9%A4%93%E3%80%8D-%E5%87%861000%E5%85%83%E7%B0%BD%E4%BF%9D%E5%AE%88%E8%A1%8C%E7%82%BA%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4%E6%8E%A7%E7%BD%AA%E7%8D%B2%E6%92%A4-883x1024.jpg\" width=\"883\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>52歲男子上月涉於超市偷取兩包蛋糕，遭店員當場揭發，他被捕後在警誡下稱因「我肚子餓」而犯案，他被控一項盜竊罪，案件今（23日）在九龍城裁判法院再提堂，他獲准以1,000元簽保守行為12個月，其控罪獲撤。</strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>被告高明（52歲，報稱無業），今獲普通話傳譯協助。他被控於今年10月5日，在黃大仙毓華里6號至10號永發大廈地下惠康超級市場偷竊兩包蛋糕（價值港幣16元），而上述物品為牛奶有限公司的財產。</p>\n<p>他同意的案情指，今年10月5日下午近4時許，涉事超市經理見被告將兩包蛋糕放進環保袋，沒有付款便離開，遂上前截停，起回被盜財物，並報警處理。被告被捕後，在警誡下稱：「我肚子餓，拿兩個蛋糕來食。」</p>\n<p>法院：九龍城裁判法院<br/>法官：裁判官莫子聰<br/>被告：高明<br/>控罪：盜竊<br/>案件編號：KCCC3208/2026</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:33:25.670607+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":376,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T10:42:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T07:17:14.114520+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:26:46.323806+00:00","content_hash":"8e309dae650ea6fce086a971f16e88f611779792b90bc8fef142fcab582e12ae","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}